# Trivy exceptions for the FinRisk container release gate.
#
# Policy
#   * CRITICAL  — always blocks the release. No exception is accepted for a CRITICAL
#                 finding in a *fixable* package.
#   * HIGH      — blocks the release too, unless a line below justifies it. An
#                 exception requires the CVE id, the reason, and the date it was
#                 reviewed; a bare CVE id in this file is a review failure.
#   * No fixed version — excluded globally by `ignore-unfixed: true`. Suppressing
#                 "there is no patch yet" adds no signal and would silently rot; the
#                 finding is re-evaluated on every run as the advisory DB updates, and
#                 becomes blocking the moment a fixed version exists.
#
# Format: one CVE id per line, preceded by a `#` comment with the justification.
#
# Empty by default: nothing is currently suppressed.
